{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2021-07-21 17:30:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., JULY 21, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.0925 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON AUGUST 18, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON AUGUST 11, 2021.'}